# KiCad board files are edited EXCLUSIVELY through the kicad-mcp MCP
# tools — the running KiCad instance owns the board. Hiding the native
# files from the AI agent closes the bypass: it can neither read nor
# edit them directly.
#
# If your project folder also contains non-board files the AI should
# see, add a negation line below.

*.kicad_pcb
*.kicad_sch
*.kicad_pro
*.kicad_prl
*.kicad_mod
*.kicad_sym
!.cursor/
!.cursor/**
